<includeonly><div class="fc-version-toolbar" data-default="{{{default|1.1}}}" data-versions="{{{versions|1.1,1.0,0.21,0.20,0.19,0.18,0.17,0.16,0.15,0.14,0.13,0.12,0.11}}}" data-label="Version" data-all="All versions" data-status="Selected version:"><span class="fc-version-fallback">Version filtering requires JavaScript. All content is currently shown.</span></div></includeonly><noinclude>
== Usage ==
Place this template at the beginning of an article:

<pre>
{{Test versions}}
</pre>

Custom version list and initial selection:

<pre>
{{Test versions|versions=1.1,1.0,0.21|default=1.1}}
</pre>

Show all versions initially:

<pre>
{{Test versions|default=all}}
</pre>

Requires the TestVersionFilter JavaScript and CSS.
</noinclude>